---
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
import { withBase } from '../../utils/paths';
---

<PageShell title="Service">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      My service contributions during this review period have primarily supported Doane University, the
      Open Learning Academy, the Biology Department, and the faculty and students served through our
      online programs. Much of this work is closely connected to my Coordinator role, including faculty
      hiring and support, course readiness, curriculum coordination, and efforts to improve the student
      experience. I view this work as an extension of my responsibility to contribute to the academic
      community beyond my own classroom.
    </p>
    <p>
      I was also nominated to serve on the faculty council and accepted this nomination. Unfortunately, I
      was not elected to hold a position at this time. However, I will continue to develop my leadership
      responsibilities and continue to express my interest in serving on faculty council in the future.
    </p>
  </div>

  <nav class="section-links" aria-label="Service sections">
    <a class="section-link" href={withBase('/service/service-to-the-university/')}>
      Service to the University
    </a>
  </nav>
</PageShell>
